   "html": "<div layer-name=\"Page\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px;padding:32px;flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;min-height:0\">\n  <div layer-name=\"Artboard Header\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--spacing-xs)\">\n    <div layer-name=\"Artboard Title\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:22px;font-weight:var(--font-weight-semibold);line-height:28px;color:var(--color-canvas-label-title);white-space:nowrap\">Alerts and dialogs</div>\n    <div layer-name=\"Type and File\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:var(--text-callout);font-weight:var(--font-weight-regular);line-height:var(--leading-callout);color:var(--color-canvas-label-body);white-space:nowrap\">System alerts and confirmation dialogs · AppCommands, RootView, TripFlows, TripBuilderView, SavedView, SpotHeaderView</div>\n    <div layer-name=\"Job\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:var(--text-body);font-weight:var(--font-weight-regular);line-height:var(--leading-body);color:var(--color-canvas-label-title);max-width:900px\">Every alert and confirmation dialog in the app. All are system chrome (NSAlert and SwiftUI .alert / .confirmationDialog); strings are the app's.</div>\n  </div>\n  <div layer-name=\"Content\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px;align-items:flex-start\">\n    <div layer-name=\"Notes\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:row;gap:var(--spacing-md);align-items:flex-start\">\n      <div layer-name=\"Note / System UI\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--spacing-xs);padding:var(--spacing-md);flex-shrink:0;width:340px;background:var(--color-canvas-note-background);border:1px solid var(--color-canvas-note-border);border-radius:var(--radius-control)\">\n        <div layer-name=\"Note Title\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:var(--text-subheadline);font-weight:var(--font-weight-semibold);line-height:var(--leading-subheadline);color:var(--color-canvas-note-text)\">System UI</div>\n        <div layer-name=\"Note Body\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:var(--text-subheadline);font-weight:var(--font-weight-regular);line-height:var(--leading-subheadline);color:var(--color-canvas-note-text)\">Drawn with the shared alert panel (app icon stand-in, bold title, grey message, full-width buttons). The real alerts are macOS system dialogs; confirmation dialogs attach to the window as sheets.</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
